    "part_1": "Heni Loukil.pdf | Contact www.linkedin.com/in/heni-loukil- aa4891240  (LinkedIn) Top Skills DevOps Deep Learning NestJSHeni Loukil Machine Learning Engineer at InstaDeep Sfax, Tunisia Experience InstaDeep Machine Learning Engineer January 2025-Present (1 year 2 months) ICube Strasbourg Geometric Deep Learning Intern February 2024-August 2024 (7 months) Strasbourg, Grand Est, France This Graduation Internship entitled",
    "part_2": " \"Alzheimer's Disease Classification Using Hippocampal Shape Morphometric Analysis with Geometric Deep Learning\" focused on Deep Graph CNN for Non-rigid registration and matching. Projecting Hippocampus shape into the pre-shape space based on Kendall’s definition, and  then into the shape space in order to ensure accurate geodesic paths between shapes and invariance in parametrization. We then extracted Dense vector ",
    "part_3": "fields features in order to perform triple classification and exceeded all state of the art methods. We also determined most affected regions of Hippocampi by Alzheimer based on tangent vectors on geodesic distances. Education INSAT - Institut National des Sciences Appliquées et de Technologie  Engineer's degree,Computer Science, Networks and Telecommunications ·(2020-2024)  Page 1 of 1 | mACHINE LEARNING engineer |  |"
